# 表单验证开发规范

## 验证组件选择优先级

### 1. Ant Design Vue 原生验证 (🏆 首选)
使用 Ant Design Vue 内置的验证系统：

```vue
<template>
  <a-form 
    :model="formData" 
    :rules="validationRules"
    @finish="handleSubmit"
    @finishFailed="handleSubmitFailed"
  >
    <a-form-item label="系统名称" name="systemName">
      <a-input v-model:value="formData.systemName" placeholder="请输入系统名称" />
    </a-form-item>
    
    <a-form-item label="邮箱地址" name="email">
      <a-input v-model:value="formData.email" placeholder="请输入邮箱地址" />
    </a-form-item>
  </a-form>
</template>

<script setup lang="ts">
import { reactive } from 'vue'

const formData = reactive({
  systemName: '',
  email: ''
})

const validationRules = {
  systemName: [
    { required: true, message: '请输入系统名称', trigger: 'blur' },
    { min: 2, max: 150, message: '系统名称长度为2-150个字符', trigger: 'blur' }
  ],
  email: [
    { required: true, message: '请输入邮箱地址', trigger: 'blur' },
    { type: 'email', message: '请输入有效的邮箱地址', trigger: 'blur' }
  ]
}
</script>
```

### 2. 项目自定义验证工具 (🥈 次选)
当需要复杂业务逻辑验证时，使用项目的验证工具：

```typescript
import { createValidationRules, businessValidationRules, asyncValidators } from '@/composables/useFormValidation'

// 使用预定义的业务验证规则
const rules = {
  systemName: businessValidationRules.systemName,
  domain: [
    ...businessValidationRules.domain,
    asyncValidators.domainNameUnique() // 异步唯一性验证
  ]
}
```

## 标准字段验证规范

### 基础字段类型验证

#### 1. 数据字典字段ID
```typescript
const dataFieldIdRules = [
  { required: true, message: '请输入字段ID', trigger: 'blur' },
  { pattern: /^[a-zA-Z_]\w{0,49}$/, message: '字母或下划线开头，可包含字母数字下划线，最长50字符', trigger: 'blur' },
  { max: 50, message: '字段ID不能超过50个字符', trigger: 'blur' }
]
```

#### 2. 名称类字段
```typescript
const nameFieldRules = [
  { required: true, message: '请输入名称', trigger: 'blur' },
  { pattern: /^([\u4e00-\u9fa5]|[a-zA-Z0-9.:&/\-_()（）、]){1,150}$/, message: '可输入中文、字母、数字和常用符号，最长150字符', trigger: 'blur' },
  { max: 150, message: '名称不能超过150个字符', trigger: 'blur' }
]
```

#### 3. 描述类字段
```typescript
const descriptionRules = [
  { max: 4096, message: '描述不能超过4096个字符', trigger: 'blur' }
]
```

#### 4. 标签字段
```typescript
const tagRules = [
  { pattern: /^([\u4e00-\u9fa5]|[a-zA-Z0-9.:\-&/_()（）、 ]){0,150}$/, message: '可输入中文、字母、数字、空格和常用符号，最长150字符', trigger: 'blur' },
  { max: 150, message: '标签不能超过150个字符', trigger: 'blur' }
]
```

### 网络相关字段验证

#### 5. IPv4地址验证
```typescript
const ipv4Rules = [
  { 
    pattern: /^(?:(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4]\d|[01]?\d\d?)\.){3}(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4]\d|[01]?\d\d?)$/, 
    message: '请输入有效的IPv4地址', 
    trigger: 'blur' 
  }
]
```

#### 6. IPv6地址验证
```typescript
const ipv6Rules = [
  { 
    pattern: /^(?:[0-9a-fA-F]{1,4}:){7}[0-9a-fA-F]{1,4}$|^::1$|^::$/, 
    message: '请输入有效的IPv6地址', 
    trigger: 'blur' 
  }
]
```

#### 7. 域名验证
```typescript
const domainRules = [
  { 
    pattern: /^(?:[a-z0-9](?:[a-z0-9-]{0,61}[a-z0-9])?\.)+[a-z0-9](?:[a-z0-9-]{0,61}[a-z0-9])?$/i, 
    message: '请输入有效的域名', 
    trigger: 'blur' 
  },
  { max: 253, message: '域名长度不能超过253个字符', trigger: 'blur' }
]
```

#### 8. URL地址验证
```typescript
const urlRules = [
  { type: 'url', message: '请输入有效的URL地址', trigger: 'blur' }
]
```

#### 9. 端口号验证
```typescript
const portRules = [
  { type: 'number', min: 1, max: 65535, message: '端口号应在1-65535之间', trigger: 'blur' }
]
```

### 联系信息验证

#### 10. 手机号验证
